-        # :mod:`.callouts`), and a footnote marker only becomes a link there
-        # (see :func:`link_footnotes`). Only pay for the second pandoc process
-        # when the document actually contains one.
+        # :mod:`.callouts`), a footnote marker only becomes a link there
